sequenceDiagram
  actor Maya
  participant Graph as CMP-003 / GRAPH-001
  participant Gateway as CMP-005 / TOOL-006
  participant Approval as CMP-006 Approval Service
  participant DB as SQLite durable store
  actor Daniel
  Maya->>Graph: start run
  Graph->>Gateway: queue review (idempotency key)
  Gateway-->>Graph: review_request_id
  Graph->>Approval: create wait + expiry
  Approval->>DB: persist wait and state
  Graph-->>Maya: waiting + callback token
  Note over Graph: process releases CPU and may stop
  Daniel->>Approval: signed token + approve/reject
  Approval->>DB: validate and store single decision atomically
  Maya->>Graph: resume run
  Graph->>DB: acquire lease and load state/event
  Graph-->>Maya: approved, rejected or timeout-escalated outcome
